<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade inactive in the panhandle area Thursday. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested.</p>
<p>Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers; 85,300 head confirmed for the week to date which includes 14,900 head formulated and 2,900 head previously contracted cattle to be shipped this week.</p>
<p>Confirmed None     Week Ago 200    Year Ago 75,900</p>
<p>Wk to Date 85,300  Week Ago 71,200 Year Ago 102,700.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
